    "description_en": "This is a non-physical software component for uniformly connecting to and accessing instruments that support SCPI commands in laboratory workflows. It manages ports, resource identifiers, and connection parameters, and provides generic write, read, query, reset, and initialization operations for higher-level instrument control.",
